Package: vaevictis-desktop
Version: 1.3.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: linuxtuts-website <292920559+linuxtuts-website@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: papirus-icon-theme, gnome-shell-extension-blur-my-shell, ptyxis, dconf-cli
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://vaevictisos.org
Description: the VaeVictis 1.3 look for systems installed from VaeVictis OS 1.1 or 1.2
 The desktop and boot screens of VaeVictis OS 1.3, made only of Debian packages
 and settings:
 .
  - the VaeVictis-Dark icon theme (folders and app icons drawn for VaeVictis)
    on top of Papirus-Dark, and GNOME's dark style, as defaults;
  - Blur my Shell switched on by default (the wallpaper behind the overview);
  - Ptyxis, the terminal of 1.3 (GNOME Terminal stays until you remove it);
  - the boot menu with a large countdown, and the boot screens at the
    monitor's own resolution, if the menu is still the one VaeVictis
    installed.
 .
 Defaults only: what a user already chose in Settings stays. Removing this
 package removes the icons and the defaults; the boot menu stays.
 .
 A Debian-based hobby project: its own tools are written with AI assistants
 and not independently audited. Provided as is, without warranty (GPL-3.0).
 Part of VaeVictis OS.
